== Purpose ==
'''Taylor's Shop''' is home to {{NPCSprite|Taylor}}, who sells cosmetics for [[SkyBlock Gems]]. There is also a basement, where the {{Zone|Fashion Shop}} and {{NPCSprite|Seymour}} is located.

